---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy — ${SITE_NAME}`}
  description={`How ${SITE_NAME} collects, uses, and protects your data, and how Google AdSense uses cookies.`}
>
  <section class="card">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">This page explains what data {SITE_NAME} collects, how it is used, and
      how advertising partners (including Google AdSense) use cookies.</p>
    <p>Last updated: 2026.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
    <p>{SITE_NAME} is a set of client-side tools. The calculators run entirely in your browser —
      the numbers you type (project dimensions, etc.) are <b>not sent to our servers</b> and are
      not stored. We do not require an account and do not collect personal information to use the tools.</p>
    <p>We may collect anonymous, aggregated usage data (such as page views and country) through
      privacy-friendly analytics to understand which tools are useful. This data cannot identify you.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>2. Advertising and cookies (Google AdSense)</h2>
    <p>This site uses Google AdSense to display ads. Google and its partners may use cookies (including
      the DART cookie) to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
        <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="nofollow">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
      <li>You can learn how Google uses data by reviewing
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="nofollow">Google's advertising privacy policy</a>.</li>
      <li>You may disable cookies in your browser settings at any time; this will not break the calculators.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Third-party ad vendors may use cookies for measurement and targeting. We do not control their
      data practices; please consult their respective privacy policies.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>3. Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>{SITE_NAME} is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal
      information from children.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>4. Your choices</h2>
    <p>You may request removal of any data we hold about you by contacting us via the
      <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>. We will respond within a reasonable timeframe.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>5. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy. Material changes will be reflected by the "Last updated" date above.</p>
    <p class="muted">Contact: see our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
